    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54510" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταμερ-ίζω&lt;&gt;</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cut in pieces</i>, [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν Πλοῦτον</span>] 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς πολλά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Tim.</u>
					12
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίθους εἰς μεγέθη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					5.13
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς πολλὰς ταλαιπωρίας τὸν θάνατον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					3.40
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, of flavours, <i>to be resolved</i> into components,
				<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Od.</u>
				65
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>distribute</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ βοεικὰ ζεύγη τοῖς λοχαγοῖς
					κατεμερίσθη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					7.5.4
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. εἰς γόχους,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταλοχίζω</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ascl.
				<u>Tact.</u>
				2.1
			</span></i>:— 
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕκαστόν τι εἰς τὴν ἑαυτοῦ φύσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>CP</u>
					5.2.5
				</span></i>
			.</div>
